# Store text as LF in the repository, whatever the local checkout does.
#
# The sources here are LF (so is the AGPL text in LICENSE, which must stay
# byte-canonical), and this project is built on Windows. Without this file a
# checkout with core.autocrlf=true rewrites every text file, so the first real
# change to any of them shows up as a whole-file diff.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Real binaries, never touched by the text filters.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.so binary
*.dll binary
*.apk binary
*.zip binary
*.keystore binary
